= The Supreme Court's Announcement

Today, the Supreme Court of Nocturnia declares that, in order to resolve the matters surrounding the *alleged* conduct of the Princess of Nocturnia, it has accepted the task requested by His Majesty, the King of Nocturnia — together with the Imperial Forum of Nocturnia — to form a Royal Tribunal.

To ensure the utmost fairness and respect, the tribunal shall be held in public and in full accordance with the Constitution.

